 of a war zone, but also mirror shards of loving memories with her and Yi Sang together.\nBehind Yi Sang is a radiant light of sorts accompanying him.\nBoth backgrounds merge in a way in the middle.\n\nThat's all, Thank you and take your time.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1mjoEtMtQpEUofBoBjKwKyK3j1kryY9ud?usp=sharing", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 2496364, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "Enchel🐾お仕事募集中", "screen_name": "Enchel", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2014153220793458688/m88EMZAR.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/15274865/1755776841/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "correction"}], "nc": 161}, {"id": 2764870, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "つなお@DLsite新刊発売中", "screen_name": "ESI_tuNAO", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1660974169159532545/q9Z25tW1.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1660973639234371585/1712406541/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 14, "complete_expiration_days": 30, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "correction"}], "nc": 128}, {"id": 2773283, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "窓拭き", "screen_name": "krei_ss_", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1991616267246321664/SkzxoBGs.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1991605733805420544/1763672936/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "po